# Betroth the Beast on Memnite on turn three. Bot2 answers with Lightning Bolt on Memnite, its only target, so the Adventure spell
# does not resolve (CR 608.2b): no Royal Role is created, and the card goes to the graveyard instead of exile (CR 715.3d, 608.2n),
# so Bot1 has no Besotted Knight to cast from exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Besotted Knight
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Besotted Knight.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite; Ability: Adventure)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl
Bot1.Graveyard = Besotted Knight; Memnite
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
